<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Johnson &amp; Johnson said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Johnson &amp; Johnson said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities upgraded Johnson &amp; Johnson to buy from hold, the office of analyst Charlene Lu confirmed.  </p>
<p>-- Cited optimism about product pipeline, with particular attention to Regranex, a topical gel for treatment of diabetic ulcers and pressure ulcers, and Lubeluzole, a neuroprotectant intended for use in treatment of ischemic strokes.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 61-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
